close_reason: Unowned and idle in-progress work is reported by pm health with exact sweep remedies and counted apart from active work by pm context
contract_change:
  api: "pm health warnings, findings and storage-check details; pm context summary; the shared remediation registry"
  before: "pm health flagged only unowned in-progress items idle past mutation_guard.stale_in_progress_hours (stale_in_progress_items, with no registry remedy), and pm context counted every in-progress item as active work"
  after: "pm health adds the advisories in_progress_unowned and in_progress_idle, details.in_progress_work (bounded ids, each group sweep, per-item recoveries) and registry remedies that are exact pm list sweeps; pm context adds in_progress_unowned and in_progress_idle to its summary when non-zero"
  migrate: "Treat the new codes like stale_in_progress_items: severity advisory, health ok unchanged; read sweep commands from remediation_map instead of hard-coding them, and read the new summary counts as optional"
